  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3115 squash-merged to master (926e3f83db, Closes #2775 and DI-151) after a main-session review. RegardingFieldMap exposes ThreadRegardingFields/ThreadRegardingColumns (every regarding column except sprk_regardingreportcard, which the thread table lacks); CommunicationArrivedProducer, CommunicationThreadReadService and ThreadResolver use them, so arrival notifications fan out and deep-link instead of falling back to private. Schema guard test pairs the list with Entity.xml. Reaches dev with the next uac-r2 dev BFF build.</completion>
